# Netlify redirects (works for drag-and-drop deploys too).
#
# 1) Proxy /api/* to the VPS-hosted API so cookie-based auth stays first-party.
/api/*  https://api.dominusnode.com/api/:splat  200!

# 2) Unknown agent-discovery paths are a 404, not the SPA (existing files win).
/docs/*         /404.html   404
/.well-known/*  /404.html   404

# 3) SPA routing (React Router)
/*      /index.html                             200

